  ],
  "quotes": [
   {
    "cat": "本季實績",
    "text": "The third quarter revenue was NT 120.744 billion.",
    "anchor": "00:02:37",
    "who": "Fanny Chen",
    "title": "Fanny Chen",
    "seg": 6
   },
   {
    "cat": "本季實績",
    "text": "Three three quarters revenue was NT 286.482 billion and the 62% growth rate across year over year.",
    "anchor": "00:02:37",
    "who": "Fanny Chen",
    "title": "Fanny Chen",
    "seg": 6
   },
   {
    "cat": "本季實績",
    "text": "The third quarter gross margin rate was 17.6%, 2.1 percentage point decrease compare with the Q2.",
    "anchor": "00:02:37",
    "who": "Fanny Chen",
    "title": "Fanny Chen",
    "seg": 6
   },
   {
    "cat": "本季實績",
    "text": "The third quarter net income was NT 13.065 billion, EPS was NT 23.39.",
    "anchor": "00:03:38",
    "who": "Fanny Chen",
    "title": "Fanny Chen",
    "seg": 7
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "The first one will be the our business performance, the broader AI infrastructure investment, our global manufacturing expansion, and our product and technology directions.",
    "anchor": "00:06:31",
    "who": "Jackal Lee",
    "title": "Jackal Lee",
    "seg": 12
   },
   {
    "cat": "資本支出",
    "text": "The external estimate presented on the slide suggest the cash capex exposure among eight major hyperscalers and the neocloud companies could reach around 1.66 trillion US dollars in the 2027, compare with the 2026 it around the 946 billion dollars.",
    "anchor": "00:10:34",
    "who": "Jackal Lee",
    "title": "Jackal Lee",
    "seg": 17
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "It is also important to recognize that every not every dollars of the investment will translate into the networking demand.",
    "anchor": "00:11:19",
    "who": "Jackal Lee",
    "title": "Jackal Lee",
    "seg": 18
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "As known in the presentation, Accton has public announcement investment commitment of the more than 1 billion US dollars across the 2026 and the 2027, covering Taiwan, Vietnam, Singapore, Malaysia, and the United States.",
    "anchor": "00:13:26",
    "who": "Jackal Lee",
    "title": "Jackal Lee",
    "seg": 21
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "Capacity expansion create option and the capability, but the actual result will depend on the demand, customer adoption, and the execution.",
    "anchor": "00:16:25",
    "who": "講者",
    "title": "講者",
    "seg": 27
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "Looking to the 2027 and behind, we see the AI infrastructure ecosystem become broader and more integrated.",
    "anchor": "00:16:47",
    "who": "講者",
    "title": "講者",
    "seg": 28
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "The AI infrastructure market will continue to evolve.",
    "anchor": "00:21:05",
    "who": "講者",
    "title": "講者",
    "seg": 36
   },
   {
    "cat": "資本支出",
    "text": "And the follow up questions is that I think recently investors are relative worried about the potential AI capex slow down in either 2027 or even in 2028.",
    "anchor": "00:49:49",
    "who": "講者",
    "title": "講者",
    "seg": 74
   }
  ],
